This plugin adapts rule content and the rule engine from the
Anthropic Claude Code plugin collection.

Source: https://github.com/anthropics/claude-plugins-official
Copyright (c) Anthropic  -  licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.
Bundled verbatim here as LICENSE-APACHE2; the Pantheon adaptations are
marked in each file's header.

The upstream stop-hook example was dropped (Pantheon has no blocking
hook at session end), and the upstream LLM suggester agent was replaced
by deterministic heuristics (see _suggest.py), because a Pantheon hook
subprocess has no supported path to reach a model.
